Such  a server propagates the time computed by the top‐level mas‐
ter.  The utility will periodically check for the presence  of  a
master  on  those  networks for which it is operating as a slave.
If it finds that there are no trusted masters on  a  network,  it
will begin the election process on that network.  One way to syn‐
